4. Facts, methods, ideas, benchmark values and independent implementations are not made exclusive simply by this notice.

See `LICENSE-SCOPE.md`, `AUTHORS`, and `CONTRIBUTING.md`. Legal review is advisable before relying on restrictions for mixed-origin code.
